Modifications and source provenance (2026-11-10)

This is a modified, standalone server distribution prepared by Colie286 from
Open1602 Vita. It is not an unmodified release of the upstream Open1602 project.
The original Open1602 base is commit
3fde8d11ca85cc783428c96839f3fd80d4827adb (version 0.3.1):
https://github.com/x4rd4s/open1602/tree/3fde8d11ca85cc783428c96839f3fd80d4827adb

The Vita port adds the master lobby/relay protocol, service and executable,
transport queue limits and compatibility changes in shared transport/core code.
This distribution supplies a standalone CMake build and a systemd service example.
ENet's unix.c contains conditional Vita socket/header adaptations; the remaining
ENet C sources, headers and LICENSE match the official v1.3.18 distribution.
The ENet CMake build file is supplied by Open1602 and adapted for this export.
https://github.com/lsalzman/enet/tree/v1.3.18

The combined server is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later. ENet retains its MIT
license and copyright notice. Existing notices in individual files remain in force.
There is no warranty; see LICENSE and third_party/enet/LICENSE.

When distributing server executables, also provide the complete corresponding
source for that exact version, including the build scripts and ENet sources,
under the terms of GPLv3 section 6. The source in this branch builds the server
without game assets, SDL, VitaSDK or the Open1602 simulation.
